-- 0056_champions_import.sql
--
-- Hand-written migration (npm run db:generate -- <name> --custom), staged as
-- drizzle/0005_champions_import.sql. drizzle/meta now records functions/db/schema.ts as it
-- is, so write the SQL that brings the database to match it. Triggers, data
-- changes and table rebuilds belong here; see migrations/README.md.
--
-- The honor roll itself: every Louisiana State Champion from 1915 to 2025
-- and every scholastic section winner from 2009 to 2021, copied from the
-- association's two champion documents (Friday, October 23, 2026). One row
-- per person per win; a tie is one row per co-champion with the same year
-- and title. Photos are the ones those documents carried, served from
-- public/champions/photos. The ids are fixed, so a second run adds nothing
-- and an admin's edit to a row is kept.
--
-- Two spellings were joined on purpose: "FM Nick Matta" (2025) is
-- "Nicholas Matta" with a note, and "Minh Bin Tran" (2021) is "Minh Binh
-- Tran". "Jim Rousselle" (1974 to 1984) and "James Rousselle" (2011, 2013)
-- are kept apart as the documents have them.

